{"title":"Corrupted tumbleweed","slug":"Corrupted_tumbleweed","hero":{"file":"Corrupted_Tumbleweed1.png.webp","width":207,"height":207},"pageid":3497,"revid":19745,"timestamp":"2025-10-02T23:53:05Z","lastEditor":"Logoking1000","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A Corrupted Tumbleweed\">A Corrupted Tumbleweed</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A Corrupted Tumbleweed</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A Corrupted Tumbleweed next to a player\">A Corrupted Tumbleweed next to a player</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A Corrupted Tumbleweed next to a player</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: corrupted tumbleweed jar\">corrupted tumbleweed jar</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>corrupted tumbleweed jar</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>corrupted tumbleweed</b> is a purple tumbleweed with a pink/purple core inside it that emits a spiral effect. It is estimated to be 2.5x-3x larger than a normal tumbleweed.\n</p><p>During the 2024 Halloween event, corrupted tumbleweed would spawn throughout the <span title=\"Oke desert (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT2tlX2Rlc2VydD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Oke Desert</span>. When approached, the tumbleweed will start rolling towards the player and deal damage on contact. When grabbed, they would immediately become docile. <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\"><span><span>&#91;</span>1<span>&#93;</span></span></sup>\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed\">Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed\">Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Sell Price of Corrupted Tumbleweed</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>A normal <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tumbleweed/\">tumbleweed</a> becomes a corrupted tumbleweed by letting a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms/\">Mysterious Mushroom</a> projectile hit the tumbleweed. It may also rarely be naturally available during future Halloween events in the case of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a> returning.\n</p><p>The corrupted tumbleweed sells for 95 snowflakes (Christmas currency).\n</p>\n<div><ol>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span><span>↑</span></span> <span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CXlhpOduNdc?si=JuCyKLiAIVua-KGD&amp;t=200\">https://youtu.be/CXlhpOduNdc?si=JuCyKLiAIVua-KGD&amp;t=200</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>"}
